--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce1d3326426d8413f86dce414ff780b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: assistant_apartment_with_clue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speaker: Player
    text: You're the one who found him and report the case right? What exactly happened
      that night?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Assistant
    text: "I  was coming to fetch him with the driver, but when i knocked on the
      door there was no answer. \n"
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Assistant
    text: So I opened the door and found him- yeah..
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: 'There''s no sign of forced entry, you have access to his apartment?

'
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Assistant
    text: "Of course. \n"
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Assistant
    text: He gave me the keys so that if there was any situation where he needed
      something from home, I can pick it up for him.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: Interesting. Hand me over the key, would you?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
